2	// Namespace imports throughout, and every constant read through a `typeof`
3	// guard: the engine lane and the pack lane converge on separate cycles, so this
4	// file spends windows beside an engine that predates one of the symbols below.
5	// A named import of an absent export is a link-time error that faults the whole
6	// pack; a guarded read simply drops that one advisory, which is the behaviour
7	// the older engine already has.
